Reject malformed unserialize input instead of crashing: a custom-object or enum
record whose payload is not a string, and an object back-reference whose index is
not an integer, were used without a type check; a back-reference that points at the
container being built freed it before the copy. msgpack_unserialize() with a template
dereferenced a null HashTable when data for an array/object property was a scalar or
shorter than the template.

diff --git a/msgpack_convert.c b/msgpack_convert.c
